### ====================================================
### OSRM Delivery Demo — API Tests
### Monaco coordinates are used (our OSRM dataset region)
### Monaco Center: lat=43.7384, lon=7.4246
### Monte Carlo:   lat=43.7396, lon=7.4278
### Fontvieille:   lat=43.7269, lon=7.4147
### Port Hercules: lat=43.7370, lon=7.4269
### ====================================================

@base = http://localhost:3000

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### ROUTING ENDPOINTS
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 1. Find best driving route between two points
POST {{base}}/routing/route
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin": { "lat": 43.7384, "lon": 7.4246 },
  "destination": { "lat": 43.7396, "lon": 7.4278 },
  "profile": "driving",
  "steps": true
}

###

### 2. Find cycling route (for bicycle delivery)
POST {{base}}/routing/route
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin": { "lat": 43.7384, "lon": 7.4246 },
  "destination": { "lat": 43.7269, "lon": 7.4147 },
  "profile": "cycling",
  "steps": true
}

###

### 3. Find nearest road/snapped point to coordinates
POST {{base}}/routing/nearest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lat": 43.7384,
  "lon": 7.4246,
  "profile": "driving"
}

###

### 4. Geocode an address (uses Nominatim)
POST {{base}}/routing/geocode
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "address": "Monte Carlo, Monaco"
}

###

### 5. Reverse geocode coordinates to address
POST {{base}}/routing/reverse-geocode
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lat": 43.7396,
  "lon": 7.4278
}

###

### 6. Distance/duration matrix (multiple points)
POST {{base}}/routing/table
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "coordinates": [
    { "lat": 43.7384, "lon": 7.4246 },
    { "lat": 43.7396, "lon": 7.4278 },
    { "lat": 43.7269, "lon": 7.4147 }
  ],
  "profile": "driving"
}

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### DELIVERY ENDPOINTS
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 7. Get all available vehicle types with fees
GET {{base}}/delivery/vehicle-types

###

### 8. Estimate delivery with MOTORBIKE
POST {{base}}/delivery/estimate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin": { "lat": 43.7384, "lon": 7.4246 },
  "destination": { "lat": 43.7269, "lon": 7.4147 },
  "vehicleType": "motorbike",
  "currency": "BDT"
}

###

### 9. Estimate delivery with CAR
POST {{base}}/delivery/estimate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin": { "lat": 43.7384, "lon": 7.4246 },
  "destination": { "lat": 43.7269, "lon": 7.4147 },
  "vehicleType": "car",
  "currency": "BDT"
}

###

