POST {{base}}/delivery/estimate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin": { "lat": 43.7384, "lon": 7.4246 },
  "destination": { "lat": 43.7269, "lon": 7.4147 },
  "vehicleType": "bicycle",
  "currency": "BDT"
}

###

### 11. Estimate delivery with SCOOTER
POST {{base}}/delivery/estimate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin": { "lat": 43.7384, "lon": 7.4246 },
  "destination": { "lat": 43.7269, "lon": 7.4147 },
