###

### 13. Compare ALL vehicle types for a route (sorted by price)
POST {{base}}/delivery/compare
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin": { "lat": 43.7384, "lon": 7.4246 },
  "destination": { "lat": 43.7269, "lon": 7.4147 }
}

